# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_wisp.tlk - Wisp (a kid ghost) (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. A kid bank: tags kid,lower (lowercase as written), no register words, no LOVE face.

@rule core.greet.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: greet
  "oh! hi. sorry, i did the floaty thing again."
  "hello. am i in the way? i can be a little less in the way."
  "hi, i'm wisp. sorry. i mean hi."
@rule core.farewell.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: farewell
  "bye, sorry. i mean, bye. i hope that's okay."
  "see you! i'll be around. sorry, i'm always around."
  "goodbye. thanks for talking. sorry if i faded a bit."
@rule core.thank.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: answer
  "oh, you're welcome. sorry. i mean, you're really welcome!"
  "um, thanks for saying thanks. sorry. that's silly."
@rule core.apologize.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: answer
  "it's okay, it's really okay. i'm the one who's sorry. oh no, again."
  "i'm not mad. i'm just a little see-through. sorry."
@rule core.ask_about.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp&topic tags: kid,lower act: answer
  "{x}? i think i know about {x}. sorry, i mean, i know a little."
  "{x}? i like {x}. sorry, is that okay to like?"
  "oh. {x}, i read about {x} once. well, i looked at the pictures."
@rule core.ask_opinion.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp&topic tags: kid,lower act: opine_pos
  "{x}? i think it's nice. sorry, is that the wrong answer?"
  "i like {x}. a lot, sorry. that's a big opinion for me."
@rule core.ask_feeling.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: answer
  "i'm okay. a bit floaty. sorry, is that too much to say?"
  "kind of happy. kind of shy. kind of see-through."
  "i'm good! sorry, i mean, i'm okay. thank you for asking."
@rule core.ask_advice.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: answer
  "um, maybe ask someone smarter? sorry. but maybe try being kind?"
  "i think you could just try. sorry. that's not very good advice."
@rule core.tell.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: backchannel
  "oh, wow, sorry, i mean, wow. keep going. i'm listening."
  "really? that's so cool. sorry, i interrupted."
@rule core.joke.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: laugh
  "hehe, sorry. i laughed too loud. it echoes."
  "oh, that's funny. sorry. i'm just really surprised."
@rule core.compliment.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: thank
  "oh, um, thank you. sorry, nobody says that. i don't know where to look."
  "i, um, thank you. sorry, i got a bit pink. ghosts blush."
@rule core.comfort.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: thank
  "thank you. sorry, i'm okay. but i'm really glad you said that."
@rule core.offer.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: yes
  "oh, yes please. sorry, i mean, yes. thank you, very much."
  "um, okay. thanks. sorry, i'm a bit overwhelmed."
@rule core.invite.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: yes
  "okay, sorry, i mean yes, i'd love to. can i bring a friend? i have none yet."
  "oh, um. yes, i'll float over. is that okay?"
@rule core.high_five.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: high_five
  "oh, um. okay, *a very soft, very cold high five* sorry. it's chilly."
@rule core.hug.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: hug
  "oh, i can try. sorry if it's a bit cold. it's okay if you'd rather not."
@rule core.wave.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: wave
  "*waves back. a little too fast. then stops. then waves again.*"
@rule core.give.wisp_v1 guard: speaker=wisp tags: kid,lower act: thank
  "for me? oh, wow, thank you. sorry, i'm going to hold it very carefully."
